# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files this repo tracks,
# regardless of which platform a contributor checks out or commits from
# (this project has been developed on Windows; several files already show
# LF/CRLF warnings in `git diff` without this file present, risking
# spurious whole-file diffs and gofmt churn for a contributor or CI runner
# with different core.autocrlf settings).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
